Author:     Nicol├ís Ceballos Brito <nicolasceballosbrito@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Wed Aug 5 17:07:18 2026 -0500
Commit:     Nicol├ís Ceballos Brito <nicolasceballosbrito@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Wed Aug 5 17:07:18 2026 -0500

    Ground booking payments and Meta session window
    
    Add deterministic Meta session window and payment grounding across Inbox AI. Key changes: new shared metaSessionWindow module and tests; groundBookingPayment and mapInboxAiAppointmentPayment in inboxAiContextFormat; include sessionWindow in InboxAiContext and Edge responses; strengthen INBOX_AI_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION to require grounded prices/payments and propose templates when closed; add pricingCatalog module and tests; preserve completeMerged transcript for window calculation; edge functions now ground payments before pricing resolution. Improves safety by preventing model-invented payments/prices and makes WhatsApp 24h window explicit.

